# Changelog — introduce-{{PRODUCT_NAME}}

All notable changes to this Skill follow [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

## Versioning Rules

| Bump | When |
|---|---|
| **MAJOR** (1.0.0 → 2.0.0) | Core positioning changes; "what it is NOT" boundary shifts; rebrand; target audience change |
| **MINOR** (1.0.0 → 1.1.0) | New module/feature added to product structure; new output recipe; new audience segment; new sub-brand |
| **PATCH** (1.0.0 → 1.0.1) | Wording refinements; updated TTL'd facts; typo fixes; new verbatim expressions added; clarifications |

## Update Discipline

- Every change to ANY file in this Skill should land here with a one-line entry.
- Every entry references the layer(s) affected (L0 / L1 / L2 / L3 / L4 / L5 / L6).
- Any TTL'd fact that gets refreshed counts as PATCH.
- Mark `[BREAKING]` for changes that invalidate older output materials (e.g., a renamed module).

